  <p><b>How it works</b></p>
  <p class="cmp-note">At every boot the plugin installs the patched Nvidia driver that matches your running Unraid kernel from the plugin's release page. The install never blocks boot: if no matching driver exists, nothing is installed and you are notified. A first install needs one <b>cold boot</b> (full power-off) before the card shows its unlocked memory.</p>
